# W.1 Launch a workflow in plain English
# A normal chat request makes the agent use Atomic's workflow tool to start the
# registered project workflow. No slash command is used for the launch.
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Type "atomic"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 12s
Set TypingSpeed 28ms
Type "Launch the registered plain-english-demo workflow in the background with topic set to src-client.ts. Use the workflow tool now, then tell me the run status."
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 90s
